Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sonic-Log Action
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}It's all right! Now let's move forward
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.03,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped hands
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.18,0:00:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.85,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation\N FUNimation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.32,0:00:32.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working together, let's ride the giant waves{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking\NHalee
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.55,0:00:37.02,OP11 Credits,,0,450,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card\N BernieCrane
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Let's hurry toward the excitement--\Nthere's the starting signal{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.14,0:00:41.03,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing\NFeeso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.01,0:00:47.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.51,0:00:47.12,OP11 Credits,,470,0,290,,Quality Checking\N Alasta\NGalaxy 9000\NMr. Luffy
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.00,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Cut through the rainbow-colored wind\Nand head for a sea of adventure{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.57,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a journey fraught with injury{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what you cherish most will be right there{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you get into a jam{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.47,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing\NGalaxy 9000
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.50,0:01:08.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always be there to protect you{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.53,0:01:13.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right! Now let's move forward{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.46,0:01:24.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.73,0:01:34.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.22,0:01:40.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.61,0:01:59.70,Title,,0,0,470,,{\fad(1200,880)}Adventure on a Long Island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unknown ship spotted at 12 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They picked a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they don't have a\Nsingle flag or sail up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of ship it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would do that to their ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing out here without sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's even weirder, the crew is\Nway too small for a ship that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, they look like they're\Ncatatonic or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just sitting around in a daze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed! Sea monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have followed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap, there's no wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and throw us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, start rowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're headed towards the sea monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wave's going to swallow them whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a giant wave filled\Nwith sea monkeys! Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship. Come\Non, man. On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to raid that ship\Nand swipe their treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we're going to get\Ncrushed by that giant wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we can't let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ain't the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's got to be the worst crew ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They only want to steal our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way do we turn? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the navigator? Give orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What navigator? Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who fired the cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late! We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bunch of worthless morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're a bunch of morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a stupid way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it's calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those gargantuan waves earlier were\Nactually caused by the sea monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humidity and temperature seem\Nlike they're pretty stable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we've got to be in the\Nnext island's climate zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been approaching\None for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, maybe tell us next\Ntime you see an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Land ahoy! Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see land!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.28,0:04:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fog looks pretty thick. Heavy fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, chopper, I need you\Nto stand forward watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, do you have any idea how long\Nwe've been waiting to see another island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you know I can't stop\Nthinking about that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't have a\Ncaptain or a navigator or
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even sails It was like\Nthey had no idea what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were doing now What\Nkind of self-respecting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates would head out to see like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they got in a battle\Nand lost captain probably got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killed and then their ship got\Nplundered But that can't be yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a look at their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in perfect condition\NNo signs of battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was still completely\Nstripped clean of anything a pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would need to survive They\Nprobably weren't even pirates then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like pirates to me,\Ncrummy pirates, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever had a good one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I wonder if there's a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they got a shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reef, don't jump up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can find a knowledgeable\Nshipwright to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the anchor ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're near the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That feeling just got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:06:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, Usopp's come down with\Nanother bout of scaredy-cat-itis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no care for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a blank slate! It's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can see is grass and trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this place is kind of depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone\Nactually lives here. Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's like they have no\Nconcept of unknown danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see clear across the island,\Nand there's no threat in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see something, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a human\Nthis furry and enormous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be some kind of bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Check out how long\Nthis apple is! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just realizing it, but\Nthe trees are long, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, is that a house over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess it kind\Nof looks like a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys related? That's\Na deer. I'm a reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything on this island is so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it get this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body feels so stretched out\Njust from thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is a point in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, the boss of\Nthe island lives in this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's probably some\Nterrifyingly long man-snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster that'll swallow us whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's home. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a giraffe out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, that's not a giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a horse with a long neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A long horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a pretty horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said thank you, and her name's Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:09:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going by the saddle she's got on\Nher, her owner must be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something up with\Nthose two bamboo trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it. Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be part of some wrong animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pig's attacking Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Bamboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Loopy!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.20,0:09:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds awfully lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay there and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I think that bamboo\Ntree was possessed by this spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They blocked in our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the ship I saw earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You looking for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we'll be happy to give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the notorious Foxy Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want more than just a fight from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want a showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spirit? Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else pops out of a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But acting like I don't\Nremember you, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you been up to all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen him. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, that would explain\Nwhy I don't remember you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tell us the truth!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.66,0:11:11.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,900)\pos(1069.8,450.4)}Nomad\NTonjit
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want my name, it's Tonjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what I intend to\Ngive you is my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been hoping someone would\Nknock me down off those stilts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, oh, they are stilts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't realize because\Nthey were so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised, I couldn't\Neven see the ground up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, just to get this straight,\Nyou're not a bamboo tree spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just an old guy whose stilts\NI happen to think were attacking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you doing walking\Naround on those stilts anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been a stilt enthusiast\NSo I decided to break some records
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make the world's longest stilts\Nby using the bamboo on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to get on them\Nwith a little effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I was too scared to climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just plain crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was up there ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you were up on those\Nstilts for ten whole years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and to make matters worse,\Nthe bamboo kept growing the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just kept getting harder\Nand harder to climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you live up there for 10 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, most of the trees on this island are\Njust as tall as my stilts, if not taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was well fed from their fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He talks about it like it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10 long years of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of stuff that's long,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how come every living creature on\Nthis island is so insanely long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might seem crazy to an\Noutsider, but there is a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you've noticed, the\Nisland is nothing but grass and trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dull, so everything grew long\Nout of a longing for excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Platypus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just said it longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one is a dachshund dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there are dangerous\Nanimals as well. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there is a snow leopard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd steer clear of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is its head the\Nonly thing that's long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to my house and let me\Nshow you some hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome! I'm starving! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acustom in this village\Nto treat visitors to extra
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,delicious milk from our\Nextra-long farm animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see any village out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the village is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All our animals, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nuts, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's been ten years, but\Nwhole villages don't just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but this is a special case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save the explanation until\Nafter we've had a nice cool drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe I've had some\Nmilk tucked away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize you were stuck on\Nthose stilts for ten years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this cheese is to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't pass off your\Ndisgusting old milk as cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to eat\Nit, I won't force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But far be it from me, till\Nthe cheese go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so you're saying it's okay\Nto eat this stuff after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some cheese tastes better\Nonce it's finally aged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your high-stress lifestyles\Nhave made your stomachs weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whereas laid-back fellows such as\Nmyself can eat whatever we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kids go on your fancy adventures,\Nbut you're shy when it comes to new food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone call the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you think was going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mara!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's food poisoning. Yeah, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're funny, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, excluding the fact that the entire\Ncamp packed up and moved on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village didn't disappear, it moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must mean the people here are nomads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, and Long Ring Long\NLand Island is our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island got its name\Nfrom its ring-like shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it's technically one big circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the tide's divided into\Nten smaller islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably wouldn't guess that all\Nof the islands were actually connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but once a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when the tides are at their lowest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can see Long Ring's true\Nform, if only for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We use this time to migrate from one\Nisland to the next every three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,circling the ring again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so everyone moved to the next island\Nwhile you were stuck up in the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But rotten luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real rebel, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they stay on each\Nisland for three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then subtracting the ten years you spent\Nliving on those stupid bamboo stilts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would still take a\Ngood 20 years for them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to come back around and\Nmeet up with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assuming you don't eat that cheese of\Nyours and die of food poisoning, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's sad but true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish I had my horse to ride again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I could cross an island\Nevery time the tides were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,low and catch up to the other\Nvillages in only five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right they're the most graceful and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beautiful animals on\Nthe whole island once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tame they can be used to cross the\Ngrassy plains with the greatest of ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without them it would be impossible\Nfor our people to migrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all our belongings\Nare far too heavy to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carry on our own and even\Nif we were strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to move all our luggage\Nthe tide would still
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rise and drown us before\Nwe could make it across.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be easier\Nto take a boat instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately we\Ndon't know how to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides even if we were\Nable to charge a log post
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here that doesn't mean it\Nwould point to the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land may be split into ten pieces\Nbut it's all part of the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose I'll just have to wait 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wait a second is a horse like a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey I almost forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw a horse on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:17:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my sweet little Shelly you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waited for me all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure grown long since I've been away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh you make me so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry if you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lonely while I was\Ngone, it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll never leave you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though everyone else left, she's\Nstill hung around all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my kind of horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it's one of\Nthem is happier right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that horse sure is fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to ride it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see why that old man\Nlikes horses so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's cross the sea together as\Nsoon as the tide is low again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've waited through rainy days and\Nyou've waited through snowy days as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from now on, we'll\Nhave nothing but sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shelly, are you sure you won't\Nwait here for Tonjit alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're taking all your friends with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come with us, Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't return to this\Nisland for 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be lonely if you\Nhave to stay here all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know where Tonjit ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth waiting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, live well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this old man's\Nafraid of heights, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a gunshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this net!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, suckers, but that horse is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you tell him, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put those losers in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, you'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, how rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never\Nseen this face before!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I know about your\Nface is that I'm gonna break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, don't get depressed, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you'd have any reason to know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make him cry, Hamburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's mine is mine, and\Nwhat's yours is mine too, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see the looks\Non your dumb faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of pants he gets so\Nworked up over some stupid horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't steal that thing myself,\Nthen somebody else would do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Come, come!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.74,0:21:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Luffy, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know my name was Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because unlike some people,\Nwe did our homework. Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy with a 100 million berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro with a 60 million-bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lump of cash like that\Nis nothing to scoff at,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially considering that you\Nonly have seven crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, with introductions out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as captain of the Foxy Pirates, I challenge\Nyou Straw Hats to a Daveyback fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:22:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that means, but\Nif you want to fight, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hearing you talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that messed up\Ncrew we saw on the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here got challenged to a Daveyback fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way do we turn? For those!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the Navigator? Give orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What Navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain! The Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta stop him. Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna end up losing our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this guy's a jerk, but\Nyou can't agree to fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoi, hoi, hoi, hoi, hoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feh, feh, feh, feh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bad, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't take backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already agreed, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, I believe you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Portia?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.07,0:22:41.23,Captions,,0,0,230,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(680,422.8)}Foxy Pirate\NFoxy The Silver Fox\NBounty: 24 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was definitely a bring it on\NI heard and once you say bring it on.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.02,0:22:43.36,Captions,,250,0,160,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(785.6,500.8)}Foxy Pirate\NFighter\NPorche
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back That's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.94,0:22:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have kept your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.57,Captions,,220,0,300,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(748.2,346.4)}Foxy Pirate\NFighter\NHamburg
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you aren't man\Nenough to keep your word!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're falling into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you step aside. Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shelly waited ten years\Nfor me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you're angry, but\Nthose are pirates, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.76,0:23:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said the fight's already started?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.73,0:23:28.36,Note,,0,0,0,,"Unruly"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.77,0:23:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Davyback fight begins\Nas soon as one captain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accepts the challenge\Nfrom the other captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No takebacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, your captain is fighting\Nour captain whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can do is sit\Nback and deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a fight, why do\NI have to sit and wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.16,0:23:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like a sports match\Nbetween different pirate crews.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, the game originated in a\Nfaraway place called Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:24:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the name implies, it's a sort\Nof secret paradise for pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the main purpose of a\NDavey-backed fight is to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plunder desirable members\Nfrom another pirate's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates plundering other pirates? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder your puny little\Ncrew only has seven members.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Davy back fight is the best\Nway to pull in some new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.46,0:24:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're so clueless,\NI'll tell you how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After each match,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.61,0:24:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the winner can take any crew member\Nthey want from the losing team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once that person is chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.02,0:24:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they gotta pledge their undying loyalty\Nto their new captain on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both crews take their oath in the name\Nof Davy Jones, the Pirate of the Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you lose, you lose a crew member?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're getting it! Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if the losing team doesn't have\Nany members worth plundering,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.06,0:24:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the winning captain can add insult to injury\Nby robbing the ship of its Jolly Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're not just betting your crewmates,\Nbut the pride of your ship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winning might make you stronger, but\Nlosing can leave you with nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well be betting your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.30,0:24:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship without a captain\Nor a navigator or sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.68,0:25:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have lost everything\Nin a Davyback fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you saw the Fang Frog Pirates,\Nor what's left of them at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.76,0:25:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we give you a chance to\Nadmire our handiwork in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.22,0:25:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let's have a round of\Napplause for our brand new recruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.66,0:25:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long live the Foxy Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I came here, I was the\Ncaptain of the Fang Frog Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.26,0:25:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was the shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We played five three-coin\Ngames and lost them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain, 13 crew members,\Nand our jolly Roger taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With so many people jumping ship, I guess\Nit was more like a merger than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.06,0:25:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not playing your stupid game.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.34,0:25:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.25,0:25:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'd\Never sink to your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that all you want, but\Nit ain't the crew's decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Davyback fight begins the second one
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captain agrees to another\Ncaptain's challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have faith in your captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't agree with\Nthe decisions he makes,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you're better off\Njoining us after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nami, but they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All pirates take an unwritten oath to\Nfollow their captain to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.86,0:26:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we turned our back on this fight\Nnow, we'd be sailing away in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better than losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe for you, but I'd rather\Ndie than live in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same goes for me. Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.14,0:26:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how men can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.94,0:26:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in arguing with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop Luffy by force if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.06,0:26:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to\Nsit back and wait for the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captains to fire a shot to signal\Nthe beginning of the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.22,0:26:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.72,0:26:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.22,0:26:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be interesting at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's agreed to the game. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.14,0:27:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.52,0:27:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could end up losing your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.06,0:27:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could lose me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.42,0:27:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm gonna win this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the Davy Mac fight\Nis officially underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.38,0:27:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sooner I can pound\Nyour face in, the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.44,0:27:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on, split-head!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.68,0:27:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like my hair cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.54,0:27:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.70,0:27:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologize to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is sensitive about his looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.64,0:27:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sensitive about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a heart of glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.46,0:27:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now listen, I'm as angry about the old\Nguy's horse as you are, but this is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.82,0:27:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use that anger to thrash us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.78,0:27:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you hurt your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.88,0:27:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.88,0:28:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sausage on the stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.98,0:28:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your sausage on the stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got it wrong, we got cheeseburgers,\Nturkey legs, yaki sabo, we got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for the opening ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.34,0:28:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Spear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.25,0:28:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.17,0:28:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hear the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.94,0:28:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All competitors, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Split Head may be a jerk, but\Nhe sure knows how to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And check out all the people he invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.52,0:28:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that his crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.43,0:28:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five jumbo yaki sobas, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.50,0:28:28.60,Captions,,0,560,180,,Cotton Candy
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.50,0:28:30.06,Captions,,350,0,400,,Fried Buckwheat Noodles
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's calm down, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.42,0:28:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.50,0:28:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Portia! Marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.66,0:28:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since our challengers have\Nnever played this game before,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go over the rules, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.12,0:28:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, whatever you\Nlose in one of the matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.54,0:28:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether it's your crew, your Jolly Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only way you can take it back\Nis with another daily-backed fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.84,0:28:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.75,0:28:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any crew member taken\Nby the winner must swear
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.48,0:28:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,undying loyalty to their\Nnew captain on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.18,0:28:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.52,0:29:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Third, if your Jolly Roger is taken, you\Ncan't ever fly it again. Never ever. Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you some cotton candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.90,0:29:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how everyone can\Nbe so calm at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's already settled, so you\Nmight as well stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.58,0:29:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.49,0:29:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you happen to break any of these rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.10,0:29:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be labeled a disgrace to\Nall pirates and banished to D .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jones' locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.91,0:29:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you swear to uphold them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.20,0:29:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.42,0:29:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three coins, three games, orthodox rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let David Jones be our witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who's this David Jones guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.88,0:29:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate who was cursed\Nby the devil and forced
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.52,0:29:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to spend all of eternity\Nat the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.04,0:29:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of\Npeople living underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.28,0:29:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what the legend says.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the ships and treasures that\Nsink beneath the waves go to his locker,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.76,0:29:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never to be seen by anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew the ocean was\Nscary, but that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.49,0:30:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davy Jones has been\Ntaking his picks from all
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorts of pirates for as\Nlong as anyone can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we call it a\NDavy-backed fight in honor of
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pirate that may someday\Nclaim your crew is his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.84,0:30:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a swordsman, a navigator, a sniper, a\Ncook, a doctor, and an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.24,0:30:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tough, but I do have to decide\Nwho it is I'm going to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it to be that one right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.68,0:30:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've landed us in a real mess, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.82,0:30:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.78,0:30:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta fill out your team roster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our party organizer needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once you've picked your\Nlineup, it's set in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't lose this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.58,0:30:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know they're gonna\Ntake Captain Usopp if we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.74,0:30:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.94,0:30:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.50,0:30:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the cute one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.92,0:30:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's time to announce the rosters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.54,0:31:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each team has chosen to\Nrepresent them in today's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I got a disease that\Nprevents me from racing.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.41,0:31:07.35,Captions,,880,0,355,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(1139,326.6)}Round 1:\NDonut Race
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.41,0:31:07.35,Captions,,0,850,350,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(165.6,325.2)}Contestants:\NUsopp, Nami, \NNico Robin
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do this stupid\Nrace either, so just man out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better not slow me down.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.35,0:31:13.00,Captions,,750,0,460,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(1093.2,200.8)}Round 2:\NGroggy Ring
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.35,0:31:13.00,Captions,,0,900,430,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(228.6,242)}Contestants:\NZoro, Sanji, Chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.88,0:31:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try and hide it.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:14.02,0:31:17.70,Captions,,780,0,590,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(964.2,454.8)}Round 3:\NCombat
Dialogue: 1,0:31:14.02,0:31:17.70,Captions,,0,900,590,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(318.2,454.8)}Contestant:\NMonkey D. Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.92,0:31:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.88,0:31:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Ikaminizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.72,0:31:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may know me as the Foxy\NPirates party organizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but today I will be your commentator.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first event of the day\Nis round one, the Donut Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legal boats for the Donut Race can only be
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,constructed from two oars\Nand three empty barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.98,0:31:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be disqualified if\Nyou use any other materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect chance\Nfor shipwrights to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.88,0:31:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And time is just about up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.02,0:31:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hat team of Navigator Nami,\NSniper Usopp, and Archaeologist Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their official craft is the Beryl Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.48,0:31:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chick with the orange\Nhair is smokin' hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.48,0:32:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am praying that the\Ndark-haired babe joins our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.64,0:32:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can keep the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.86,0:32:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.24,0:32:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.15,0:32:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.14,0:32:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final haunts are end!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The top spot goes to our idle\Nand fellow foxy pirate, Parcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.20,0:32:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're too kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.54,0:32:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joining her is the Fishman Capote!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.94,0:32:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their vessel is the cutie wagon\Nled by the star shark, Monda!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.90,0:32:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, take him down,\NPortia, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you've got a\Nshark pool in your boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear him mention any\Nrules forbidding the use of sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll continue to provide\Ncommentary throughout the race?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.76,0:32:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a bird's eye view of the\Naction from atop Chirp Chirp,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rare South Blue Super Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.42,0:32:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chirp Chirp!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.66,0:32:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure this won't sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I am not a\Nprofessional shipwright, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, on your marks!

